5 words to never say in AI copywriting.

2
00:00:04,430 --> 00:00:12,950
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say game-changer, instead say turns things around - because

3
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:15,750
people cliche alerts.

4
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:21,160
Don't say delve, instead say dig into - nobody says delve.

5
00:00:21,340 --> 00:00:27,510
Don't say revolutionize, instead say change - nobody believes revolution.

6
00:00:27,690 --> 00:00:33,280
